						<r3d:remarks>Survey of Health, Ageing and Retirement in Europe is covered by Thomson Reuters Data Citation Index. In March 2011, the Survey of Health, Ageing and Retirement in Europe (SHARE) became the first European Research Infrastructure Consortium (ERIC). The SHARE Research Data Center complies with the Criteria of the German Council for Social and Economic Data for providing access to microdata. SHARE is a member of the RatSWD - research data - infrastructure.</r3d:remarks>
